A '''hyperlane''' ran through the [[Outer Rim Territories]], linking the [[Sanrafsix system]]<ref name="TFABG" /> in the [[Grumani sector]]<ref name="Sanrafsix" /> to the [[Cotellier system]]<ref name="TFABG" /> in the [[Rseik sector]].<ref name="Cotellier" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, this route was known as the [[Sanrafsix Corridor]], and was first mapped in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''.<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

